WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,560
Those of us who are familiar with the whipping competition can't do anything.

2
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:11,870
So it's up to the five of you to figure out when to set off.

3
00:00:13,450 --> 00:00:15,050
There are five of us again

4
00:00:15,450 --> 00:00:17,650
That's the heir to a large tribe

5
00:00:17,770 --> 00:00:19,530
worlds apart

6
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:21,320
their guardian

7
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:27,900
At the very least, no one can rest assured

8
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:30,460
Of course I won't let just the five of you go.

9
00:00:30,460 --> 00:00:32,300
Intercept Prince Tamu's team

10
00:00:32,880 --> 00:00:34,040
I’ll send you this time

11
00:00:34,040 --> 00:00:39,240
They are just responsible for assisting them. Who are they?

12
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:44,110
It was Zhu Mengzhong's lover who got out of trouble

13
00:00:44,510 --> 00:00:57,440
It's better to report back to the former North Korean leader and the Guards Commander

14
00:00:57,800 --> 00:00:58,760
When does the mission start?

15
00:00:59,660 --> 00:01:00,700
Because it's urgent

16
00:01:01,060 --> 00:01:03,100
The people from Jinyiwei are still on their way here

17
00:01:03,540 --> 00:01:05,340
It will take almost a day to get there.

18
00:01:05,580 --> 00:01:07,540
So you have a day to rest
